      "prefLabel": "Climate risk",
      "altLabel": ["hazard exposure", "climate-related risk"],
      "definition": "Potential for adverse consequences for human or ecological systems, arising from the dynamic interaction between climate-related hazards and the exposure and vulnerability of the affected systems.",
      "source": "IPCC AR6 WGII Glossary: Risk",
