      "notation": "CRK_136",
      "prefLabel": "Biological hazard",
      "altLabel": ["biotic hazard"],
      "definition": "Climate hazard arising from living organisms whose distribution, abundance, or activity is influenced by climate variability or change, including pests, pathogens, and invasive species that harm agricultural and ecological systems.",
      "source": "IPCC AR6 WGII Ch.2",
