      "notation": "CRK_114",
      "prefLabel": "Tropical cyclone",
      "altLabel": ["cyclone", "hurricane", "typhoon"],
      "definition": "Storm characterised by a strong, cyclonic-scale disturbance originating over tropical oceans; classed as a tropical storm at one-minute mean surface winds of 18 to 32 m/s, and as a hurricane, typhoon, or cyclone above 32 m/s depending on geographic location.",
      "source": "IPCC AR6 WGI Annex VII Glossary: Tropical cyclone",
