      "prefLabel": "Climate exposure",
      "altLabel": ["exposure to climate", "exposure to climate hazards", "exposure to climate change", "climate-exposed", "exposed to climate risk"],
      "definition": "Climate risk component referring to the presence of people, livelihoods, species, ecosystems, infrastructure, or assets in places and settings that could be adversely affected by climate hazards.",
      "source": "IPCC AR6 WGII Glossary (Exposure)",
