      "prefLabel": "Index insurance",
      "altLabel": ["Index-based insurance", "parametric insurance", "Index-based drought insurance", "Index-based livestock insurance"],
      "definition": "Climate insurance that pays out when a weather, climate, or remotely sensed index (such as rainfall, temperature, NDVI, or forage condition) associated with climate-related losses crosses a predefined threshold, rather than on individual damage assessment.",
