      "definition": "Cross-cutting concept denoting harm to ecosystems, natural resources or environmental quality.",
      "source": "UNEP (environmental damage)",
      "topConceptOf": "https://mlolita26.github.io/cgiar-climate-taxonomy/scheme",
      "scopeNote": "Counts as adaptation when: Outcome is measured against a climate hazard (e.g. yield under drought), OR is produced by a qualifying intervention, OR an adaptation-specific principle or cross-cutting concept applies to it; NOT adaptation when it is a plain level or quantity result not framed against a climate stressor.",
